        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga ajeagu Yohaneeda Abaatiisachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata giidawda adaw Yesu giinealangaaschi atamaniyeenya iitaanyi, ghabeawa hoowa ak gawa goonealshi aba jeeda mujiinajeega nyaawa nea gwarukwiida Giijasta miy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Yohaneeda Abaatiisachi iita gissina Yesu nea gwanda ghealooniga, hean goojeakta giinealangaaschi ghoanyaash ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayeesha, “Asi ang'iing'i guwoosi siida ghayi jea ghwahidu ghana jea eefurda nuut?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu ak gwayeesha saawa, “Aweayeena ak goorukusi Yohana iita ng'asheega oayiinyi ea gea oadaayi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuga ng'oowi ghoang'wearda, fuga badeeda gaweelweel, gea bearji udamusuura geamiidu, gea miinyi gwayiing'shi, fuga meewa gwaduutu nea fuga barbari geerukusa Giijasta Miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghang'wana siida mwasida gil aba badaydeanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eatng'eat gabiikta, gwarukusa Yesu eemeeda ghwanyawa badageat iita Yohana, “Gooweayi adaaha naaha aba dareapcheeda? Nyeeshtooda ayuuk jeameeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gooweayi adaaha naaha? Siida akwa hang'weaka oormajeega? Ng'ula fuga akweali hang'weaka oormajeega goobiita gealga sugoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghwasaan anda gooriti? Gooweayi adaaha naaha? Sibaneeda? Ea, geayeeshiineegwa eara dea haweewa sibaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih siida sing'oorsa ng'asheesuun gil,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gaydagala naaha seaygeani? Gawuurji diibiga mida naada, guuriisa suurja nea gwayeeniisa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiinajeega mandeawana masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu goojuursa mujiinajeegiga ghayi sissa niny ng'asheega deamdeameadi ak ea maduukuunana riing'eega nyaawaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ashageada geat Gurasini! Ashageada geat Betsayda! Aba gideaba ng'asheegiga ghayi deamdeameadi sisissa jeedeang'wean, inyeeda ghayi geesissa mujiineeda Diro ea Sidoni, gajea nigeawiit gwaduukuuna ng'asheega munyas ak ghwayeashta deareeda nea gookwa guniyajeega",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Deareeda ea guniyajeega: Ghoahiimu gideaba niduukuuna riing'oojiga nyaawa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geayeeshiineegwa, gajeawusus gideaba gayghamilikghta ghoorjooda nyaawa Diro ea Sidoni ea ghwalaabwaneegwa hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ang'iing'i Gapernaumu, gajeetiing'neey ea gula humng'eeda? Gajeahiing'neeyi ea una jeeda maloonghajeega. Aba gideaba inyeeda ghayi ng'asheega deamdeameadi sisin aba ng'eang'deang'wa geesissa mujiineeda Sodoma, gwachi mujiineedida gajea gudugwanda ea gagul ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayeeshiineegwa, eaweeda girgweaksinda gaynyasa ang'iing'i ghoorjooda haw adaraam dea Sodoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apkaani heedeanyu ak goofuufchi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida gwayi Yesu, “Geabadiischooweey ea Bwaabeeda was Ng'utamiida humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba gifunyi ng'asheesu fuga weaghoodi ea fuga mideawa fughareenga ak giihiimsi diibiga manang'i; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Bwaabwa nih gweagu gideaba gidubwariiydi, ang'iing'i gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigoonan Bwaabwa haleanjeeda sean. Manda siida nal Orjeeda geaghus Ghweanda, ghana siida nal Bwaabwa geaghus Orjeeda ghana siida wassean gasa Orjeeda goohiimsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apkaani heedeanyu oogasean agoogeeda deawiit nea ghabwaanyeegwa sareenda, ak gaydeafuufeegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghasana geat yookeedeanyu, ak ghoanaalanaan ng'asheega; aba gideaba aniini geewooschi ng'eeni nea geayeadayi geaw ng'eanyi aba guroroodeanyu, ak abeeda gajanyasa hooseaneega aba jeesingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba yookeedeanyu ea bumbun nea sareendeanyu ea asas!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
